"stay!"
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, <strong>ແອັບເຮືອນພັກ (Guest House App)</strong> "
"ຍັງຊ່ວຍທ່ານຈັດການຂັ້ນຕອນສິ້ນສຸດການເຂົ້າພັກໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍ!"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively to individual resource blocking slots described earlier, you "
"can select a resource this leave applies to."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກການປິດກັ້ນຊ່ອງເວລາຕາມແຕ່ລະຊັບພະຍາກອນດັ່ງທີ່ກ່າວມາແລ້ວ, "
"ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເລືອກຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຕ້ອງການນຳໃຊ້ການລາພັກ/ການປິດນີ້ໄດ້."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively, switch to the list view, and then change the resource.<br/"
">Be\n"
"                    careful not to double book a resource with such change!"
msgstr ""
"ຫຼື ປ່ຽນໄປເປັນມຸມມອງລາຍການ (List view), ແລ້ວປ່ຽນຊັບພະຍາກອນ.<br/>ຄວນ\n"
"                    ລະມັດລະວັງບໍ່ໃຫ້ເກີດການຈອງຊ້ອນກັນໃນຊັບພະຍາກອນດຽວກັນ!"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively, switch to the list view, which is more suitable if the "
"booking is\n"
"                    not during the visualized date range and update the "
"booking date range."
msgstr ""
"ຫຼື ປ່ຽນໄປເປັນມຸມມອງລາຍການ ເຊິ່ງເໝາະສົມກວ່າຖ້າການຈອງນັ້ນ\n"
"                    ບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃນຊ່ວງວັນທີທີ່ກຳລັງສະແດງຢູ່ ແລ້ວປັບປຸງຊ່ວງວັນທີຈອງ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively, type in the search bar and select the appropriate filter."
msgstr "ຫຼື ພິມລົງໃນແຖບຄົ້ນຫາ ແລ້ວເລືອກຕົວກັ່ນຕອງທີ່ຕ້ອງການ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can create a slot as placeholder from the planning "
"directly:"
msgstr "ຫຼື ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຊ່ອງກຳນົດເວລາໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຈາກແຜນວຽກ:"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid "An address must be specified for a map to be embedded"
msgstr "ຕ້ອງລະບຸທີ່ຢູ່ເພື່ອສະແດງແຜນທີ່"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid "Any question?"
msgstr "ມີຄຳຖາມຫຍັງບໍ່?"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Anyone can create a portal account on your database.<br/>Open your website "
"home page\n"
"                in a private tab to do so."
msgstr ""
"ທຸກຄົນສາມາດສ້າງບັນຊີ Portal ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານໄດ້.<br/>ເປີດໜ້າທຳອິດຂອງເວັບໄຊ\n"
"                ໃນແທັບແບບສ່ວນຕົວ (Incognito) ເພື່ອທົດລອງສ້າງ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Assign them a resource, which helps you keeping track."
msgstr "ມອບໝາຍຊັບພະຍາກອນໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາ ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນການຕິດຕາມໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"At any time during their stay, open their rental order from the Guest House "
"App."
msgstr ""
"ໃນລະຫວ່າງທີ່ແຂກກຳລັງເຂົ້າພັກ, ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດໃບສັ່ງຈອງ/"
"ເຊົ່າຂອງພວກເຂົາຈາກແອັບເຮືອນພັກໄດ້ຕະຫຼອດເວລາ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"At any time from the guest order, use the Send message capability in the "
"chatter\n"
"                    to exchange with your guest."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນ 'ສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມ' ໃນຊ່ອງສົນທະນາ (Chatter) ຈາກໃບສັ່ງຈອງຂອງແຂກ\n"
"                    ເພື່ອຕິດຕໍ່ສື່ສານກັບແຂກຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ທຸກເວລາ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"At any time you can adjust the city tax count delivered by re-opening the "
"city tax widget clicking the City Tax button on the guest order."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດປັບຈຳນວນອາກອນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ/ອາກອນເມືອງໄດ້ທຸກເວລາ ໂດຍການເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງອາກອນຄືນໃໝ່ "
"ຜ່ານການກົດປຸ່ມ City Tax ໃນໃບສັ່ງຈອງຂອງແຂກ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "At the end of their stay, they'll be able to pay for all those extras."
msgstr "ເມື່ອສິ້ນສຸດການເຂົ້າພັກ, ແຂກຈະສາມາດຊຳລະຄ່າບໍລິການເສີມທັງໝົດເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Because keeping an eye on your business performance matter, the module comes "
"with a dedicated dashboard."
msgstr ""
"ຍ້ອນການຕິດຕາມຜົນການດຳເນີນທຸລະກິດມີຄວາມສຳຄັນ, ໂມດູນນີ້ຈຶ່ງມາພ້ອມກັບແຜງໜ້າປັດ (Dashboard) "
"ໂດຍສະເພາະ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Beyond daily operations, the Steering menu serves as the \"Captain’s "
"Bridge\" of your guest house. It provides a 500-day horizon to anticipate "
"market trends, manage risks, and optimize your revenue."
msgstr ""
"ນອກເໜືອຈາກການເຮັດວຽກປະຈຳວັນ, ເມນູ Steering ປຽບເໝືອນ \"ຫ້ອງຄວບຄຸມຫຼັກ\" "
"ຂອງເຮືອນພັກຂອງທ່ານ. ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຫັນພາບລວມລ່ວງໜ້າເຖິງ 500 ວັນ ເພື່ອຄາດການທ່າອ່ຽງຂອງຕະຫຼາດ, "
"ຄຸ້ມຄອງຄວາມສ່ຽງ ແລະ ສ້າງລາຍຮັບໃຫ້ເກີດປະໂຫຍດສູງສຸດ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Blocking resources"
msgstr "ການປິດກັ້ນຊັບພະຍາກອນ"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Booking a room"
msgstr "ການຈອງຫ້ອງພັກ"

#. module: guest_house
#: model:product.template,name:guest_house.product_template_12
msgid "Breakfast (1 guest)"
msgstr "ອາຫານເຊົ້າ (ແຂກ 1 ທ່ານ)"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:guest_house.product_template_14
msgid ""
"Bright, airy and full of natural light, from sun-drenched mornings to "
"soothing evenings."
msgstr ""
"ສະຫວ່າງ, ໂປ່ງສະບາຍ ແລະ ເຕັມໄປດ້ວຍແສງທຳມະຊາດ, ຕັ້ງແຕ່ຕອນເຊົ້າທີ່ມີແສງແດດອ່ອນໆ "
"ຈົນເຖິງຕອນແລງທີ່ແສນສະຫງົບ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"By default, Odoo brings taxes and fiscal positions into your database "
"depending on your location. These are pre-configured to ease your selling "
"abroad, but they may require a small configuration if you need to apply the "
"local tax rate even to foreign customers."
msgstr ""
"ຕາມຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, Odoo ຈະກຳນົດອາກອນ ແລະ ສະຖານະທາງການເງິນ (Fiscal Positions) "
"ເຂົ້າໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຕາມທີ່ຕັ້ງຂອງທ່ານ. ລະບົບໄດ້ກຳນົດຄ່າລ່ວງໜ້າເພື່ອໃຫ້ສະດວກຕໍ່ການຂາຍໃຫ້ຕ່າງປະເທດ, "
"ແຕ່ອາດຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພີ່ມເຕີມເລັກນ້ອຍ ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການນຳໃຊ້ອັດຕາອາກອນທ້ອງຖິ່ນກັບລູກຄ້າຕ່າງປະເທດນຳ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"By uploading this module's demo data, your database has been filled with a "
"few products,\n"
"            sale orders and more."
msgstr ""
"ການໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງຂອງໂມດູນນີ້ ຈະເພີ່ມສິນຄ້າຕົວຢ່າງ,\n"
"            ໃບສັ່ງຂາຍ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນອື່ນໆ ເຂົ້າໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Charge your customer for the resulting amount and you're all set!"
msgstr "ຮຽກເກັບເງິນຈາກລູກຄ້າຕາມຈຳນວນເງິນດັ່ງກ່າວ ແລ້ວກໍສຳເລັດຂັ້ນຕອນ!"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Charge your guests"
msgstr "ຮຽກເກັບເງິນຈາກແຂກ"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Check and adjust if needed the number of guests who stayed in each room. "
"Then confirm the number of city taxes to be charged, which updates the "
"delivered city tax count."
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບ ແລະ ປັບປ່ຽນຈຳນວນແຂກທີ່ເຂົ້າພັກໃນແຕ່ລະຫ້ອງຕາມຄວາມຈຳເປັນ. "
"ຈາກນັ້ນຢືນຢັນຈຳນວນອາກອນທ້ອງຖິ່ນທີ່ຈະຮຽກເກັບ, ເຊິ່ງລະບົບຈະປັບປຸງຍອດອາກອນທ້ອງຖິ່ນຕົວຈິງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check guests in"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນແຂກເຂົ້າພັກ (Check-in)"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check guests out"
msgstr "ລົງທະບຽນແຂກອອກ (Check-out)"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check information and then confirm the booking."
msgstr "ກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນ ແລ້ວຢືນຢັນການຈອງ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Check the invoice data and confirm it."
msgstr "ກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ ແລ້ວຢືນຢັນ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
"Check-in is from 3:00 PM and check-out is until 11:00 AM. Early or late "
"arrangements can often be made on request."
msgstr ""
"ເວລາເຂົ້າພັກແມ່ນເລີ່ມແຕ່ 15:00 ໂມງ ແລະ ເວລາອອກແມ່ນບໍ່ເກີນ 11:00 ໂມງ. "
"ສາມາດຮ້ອງຂໍເຂົ້າພັກກ່ອນເວລາ ຫຼື ອອກຊ້າກວ່າກຳນົດໄດ້."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"City Taxes are to be billed to spent nights in practice and not in theory "
"and are counted as the sum of nights each guest stayed."
msgstr ""
"ອາກອນທ້ອງຖິ່ນຈະຖືກຮຽກເກັບຕາມຈຳນວນຄືນທີ່ເຂົ້າພັກຕົວຈິງ "
"ໂດຍຄິດໄລ່ຈາກຜົນລວມຂອງຈຳນວນຄືນທີ່ແຂກແຕ່ລະຄົນເຂົ້າພັກ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click one of the room to book."
msgstr "ກົດເລືອກຫ້ອງໃດໜຶ່ງເພື່ອດຳເນີນການຈອງ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Click the Check in button to confirm they are now staying at your place!"
msgstr "ກົດປຸ່ມ Check-in ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນວ່າແຂກໄດ້ເຂົ້າພັກແລ້ວ!"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click the Check out button to capture they return you the keys."
msgstr "ກົດປຸ່ມ Check-out ເພື່ອບັນທຶກວ່າແຂກໄດ້ສົ່ງມອບກະແຈຄືນແລ້ວ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click the Create Order to open the order form."
msgstr "ກົດປຸ່ມ 'ສ້າງໃບສັ່ງ' ເພື່ອເປີດແບບຟອມ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Click the Invoice button with a full invoice."
