msgstr "ສາມາດຕິດຕໍ່ສອບຖາມພວກເຮົາໄດ້ທຸກເລື່ອງ ກ່ຽວກັບເຮືອນພັກ&amp;nbsp;ຫຼື ການບໍລິການຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Duplicate the sales tax that applies to your stay offer and rename the "
