msgstr "ການມອບໝາຍວຽກໃຫ້ພະນັກງານ"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Employee would open the tasks from their portal access and update the task "
"stage."
msgstr "ພະນັກງານສາມາດເປີດເບິ່ງໜ້າວຽກຜ່ານລະບົບ Portal ແລະ ປັບປຸງສະຖານະຂອງໜ້າວຽກໄດ້."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Enforce local tax rate"
msgstr "ບັງຄັບໃຊ້ອັດຕາອາກອນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:guest_house.product_template_20
msgid ""
"Enjoy a beautifully arranged board featuring a curated selection of local "
"cheeses, premium cured meats, fresh bread, and seasonal accompaniments."
msgstr ""
"ເພີດເພີນກັບຖາດອາຫານທີ່ຈັດແຕ່ງຢ່າງສວຍງາມ ປະກອບດ້ວຍເນີຍແຂງທ້ອງຖິ່ນຊັ້ນດີ, ຊີ້ນແຫ້ງຄຸນນະພາບພິເສດ, "
"ເຂົ້າຈີ່ສົດ ແລະ ເຄື່ອງຄຽງຕາມລະດູການ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Example: A room for 2 is booked for 4 nights, two guests were here for the "
"first three nights but only one stayed the last night. Then the guests x "
"nights is 2x3+1x1=7."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຫ້ອງສຳລັບ 2 ທ່ານ ຖືກຈອງເປັນເວລາ 4 ຄືນ, ມີແຂກ 2 ທ່ານ ເຂົ້າພັກໃນ 3 ຄືນທຳອິດ ແຕ່ພັກພຽງ "
"1 ທ່ານ ໃນຄືນສຸດທ້າຍ. ຈຳນວນແຂກ x ຄືນ ຈະເທົ່າກັບ 2x3 + 1x1 = 7."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_home
msgid "Experience the Comfort of our Guest House"
msgstr "ສຳຜັດຄວາມສະດວກສະບາຍຂອງເຮືອນພັກພວກເຮົາ"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"Experience the warmth and comfort of our guest house, where every stay feels "
"like a home away from home. Our dedicated staff ensures that your visit is "
"relaxing and memorable."
msgstr ""
"ສຳຜັດຄວາມອົບອຸ່ນ ແລະ ຄວາມສະດວກສະບາຍຂອງເຮືອນພັກພວກເຮົາ "
"ບ່ອນທີ່ທຸກການພັກຜ່ອນໃຫ້ຄວາມຮູ້ສຶກສະບາຍຄືຢູ່ບ້ານຂອງທ່ານເອງ. "
"ທີມງານຂອງພວກເຮົາພ້ອມດູແລເພື່ອໃຫ້ການພັກຜ່ອນຂອງທ່ານໜ້າປະທັບໃຈ ແລະ ຜ່ອນຄາຍທີ່ສຸດ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.template_footer_descriptive
msgid "Follow us"
msgstr "ຕິດຕາມພວກເຮົາ"

#. module: guest_house
#: model:product.template,name:guest_house.product_template_11
msgid "Free Cancellation"
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກການຈອງຟຣີ"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:guest_house.product_template_11
msgid ""
"Free cancellation up to 48h prior your stay.<br>50% refund within the 48h."
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກຟຣີກ່ອນເຂົ້າພັກ 48 ຊົ່ວໂມງ.<br>ຄືນເງິນ 50% ຫາກຍົກເລີກພາຍໃນ 48 ຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
"From downtown San Francisco, follow US-101 South and exit at Bayshore "
"Boulevard. Turn left onto Executive Park Blvd, then continue straight until "
"you reach 250 Executive Park Blvd. Parking is available on-site near Suite "
"3400."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກໃຈກາງເມືອງ San Francisco, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ເສັ້ນທາງ US-101 South ແລ້ວອອກທີ່ Bayshore "
"Boulevard. ລ້ຽວຊ້າຍເຂົ້າສູ່ Executive Park Blvd, ແລ້ວຂັບກົງໄປຈົນຮອດ 250 Executive Park "
"Blvd. ມີບ່ອນຈອດລົດຢູ່ໃກ້ກັບ Suite 3400."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"From the <strong>Guest House App</strong>, you can manage your bookings.<br/"
