msgstr "ສະໄລ້ຕໍ່ໄປ"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:guest_house.product_template_11
msgid "No refund on no-show."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີການຄືນເງິນໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ບໍ່ມາເຂົ້າພັກ (No-show)."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Now that they relax, you can offer extra services to make your guests feel "
"even more\n"
"            comfortable!"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອແຂກໄດ້ພັກຜ່ອນສະບາຍແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດສະເໜີການບໍລິການເສີມຕ່າງໆ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແຂກຮູ້ສຶກ\n"
"            ສະດວກສະບາຍຍິ່ງຂຶ້ນ!"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Now that you have several companies or branches, you may want some of your "
"employees to access only to some of them in case they always work in some of "
"your places."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານມີຫຼາຍບໍລິສັດ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍສາຂາ, "
"ທ່ານອາດຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ພະນັກງານບາງຄົນເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ສະເພາະບາງສາຂາທີ່ພວກເຂົາປະຈຳການຢູ່."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Odoo offers you infinite possibilities, such as:"
msgstr "Odoo ມອບຄວາມສາມາດຫຼາກຫຼາຍທີ່ບໍ່ມີຂີດຈຳກັດ ເຊັ່ນ:"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Of course, this is just an overview of the features included in this "
"package. Feel free\n"
"            to add new apps, delete/modify demo data, and test everything "
"around!"
msgstr ""
"ແນ່ນອນ, ນີ້ເປັນພຽງພາບລວມຂອງຄຸນສົມບັດໃນແພັກເກດນີ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດ\n"
"            ເພີ່ມແອັບໃໝ່, ລຶບ/ແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງ ແລະ ທົດລອງໃຊ້ງານທຸກລະບົບໄດ້ຕາມໃຈ!"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"On a daily basis, house keeping tasks are created depending on the current "
"stays and assigned to employees that have house keeping shifts."
msgstr ""
"ໃນແຕ່ລະວັນ, ໜ້າວຽກແມ່ບ້ານຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍອີງຕາມການເຂົ້າພັກຕົວຈິງ ແລະ "
"ຖືກມອບໝາຍໃຫ້ພະນັກງານທີ່ມີກະປະຈຳການທຳຄວາມສະອາດ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "On a resource to block line, click, drag and drop to create a slot."
msgstr "ໃນແຖວຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ຕ້ອງການປິດກັ້ນ, ໃຫ້ກົດ, ລາກ ແລະ ວາງ ເພື່ອສ້າງຊ່ອງເວລາ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "On top of guest and stay management, you need to keep the place clean!"
msgstr "ນອກຈາກການດູແລແຂກ ແລະ ຫ້ອງພັກແລ້ວ, ຄວາມສະອາດຂອງສະຖານທີ່ກໍເປັນສິ່ງສຳຄັນທີ່ສຸດ!"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Once confirmed, the payment is done and the order booked seamlessly!"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຢືນຢັນແລ້ວ, ການຊຳລະເງິນຈະສຳເລັດ ແລະ ການຈອງຈະຖືກບັນທຶກທັນທີ!"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Once defined, you can switch between companies or branches from the company "
"selector at the top right of your screen.<br/>This will expose depending on "
"where you are, only the selected companies and branches data."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າແລ້ວ, ທ່ານສາມາດສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງບໍລິສັດ ຫຼື ສາຂາ ໄດ້ຈາກປຸ່ມເລືອກບໍລິສັດຢູ່ມຸມຂວາເທິງຂອງໜ້າຈໍ."
"<br/>ລະບົບຈະສະແດງສະເພາະຂໍ້ມູນຂອງບໍລິສັດ ແລະ ສາຂາທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Once done adding all the necessary rooms, click on a recently added slot and "
"then\n"
"                click the rental order link."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເພີ່ມຫ້ອງພັກທີ່ຕ້ອງການຄົບແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ກົດທີ່ຊ່ອງເວລາທີ່ຫາກໍເພີ່ມ\n"
"                ແລ້ວກົດລິ້ງໃບສັ່ງຈອງ/ເຊົ່າ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Once done, let's click, drag and drop on another room line to create a slot."
msgstr "ເມື່ອສຳເລັດ, ໃຫ້ກົດ, ລາກ ແລະ ວາງ ໃສ່ແຖວຫ້ອງອື່ນ ເພື່ອສ້າງຊ່ອງເວລາ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Once done, loggin as a portal user."
msgstr "ເມື່ອສຳເລັດ, ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໃນຖານະຜູ້ໃຊ້ Portal."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open a room page from the website and scroll down to the Customer Reviews "
"section."
msgstr "ເປີດໜ້າຫ້ອງພັກຈາກເວັບໄຊ ແລ້ວເລື່ອນລົງໄປທີ່ສ່ວນ 'ຄຳຕິຊົມຈາກລູກຄ້າ' (Customer Reviews)."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open now, the Tasks from the accommodation app, House Keeping menu.<br/>This "
"is\n"
"                the daily list of house keeping tasks to be tackled."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດເມນູ Tasks ຈາກແອັບຫ້ອງພັກ, ເມນູ House Keeping.<br/>ນີ້ແມ່ນ\n"
"                ລາຍການໜ້າວຽກແມ່ບ້ານປະຈຳວັນທີ່ຕ້ອງດຳເນີນການ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the <strong>Settings App</strong> and reach the companies from the menu "
"Users &amp; Companies."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ <strong>ແອັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (Settings App)</strong> ແລ້ວເລືອກເມນູ Companies ພາຍໃຕ້ "
"Users &amp; Companies."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the <strong>Settings App</strong> and reach the users from the menu "
"Users &amp; Companies."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດ <strong>ແອັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (Settings App)</strong> ແລ້ວເລືອກເມນູ Users ພາຍໃຕ້ Users "
"&amp; Companies."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the <strong>Website App</strong> and navigate to the Rooms."
msgstr "ເປີດ <strong>ແອັບເວັບໄຊ (Website App)</strong> ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ເມນູ Rooms (ຫ້ອງພັກ)."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Board from the accommodation app, House Keeping menu.<br/>Here you "
"have an\n"
"                overview of the cleanness state of your resources."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດເມນູ Board ຈາກແອັບຫ້ອງພັກ, ເມນູ House Keeping.<br/>ບ່ອນນີ້ທ່ານຈະເຫັນ\n"
"                ພາບລວມສະຖານະຄວາມສະອາດຂອງຫ້ອງພັກທັງໝົດ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Default pricelist from the configuration menu."
msgstr "ເປີດລາຍການລາຄາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (Default pricelist) ຈາກເມນູການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Default pricelist to see the existing price rules which apply to it."
msgstr "ເປີດລາຍການລາຄາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ເພື່ອກວດເບິ່ງກົດລະບຽບລາຄາທີ່ມີຢູ່."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Guest House App and navigate to the Configuration / Leaves menu."
msgstr "ເປີດແອັບເຮືອນພັກ ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ເມນູ Configuration / Leaves."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Guest House App and then navigate to the orders from the menu."
msgstr "ເປີດແອັບເຮືອນພັກ ແລ້ວໄປທີ່ເມນູໃບສັ່ງຈອງ (Orders)."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Guest House App to appreciate the currently planned bookings with "
"the\n"
"                Schedule."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດແອັບເຮືອນພັກ ເພື່ອກວດເບິ່ງຕາຕະລາງການຈອງທີ່ມີແຜນໄວ້\n"
"                ຜ່ານເມນູ Schedule (ຕາຕະລາງ)."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Planning from the accommodation app, House Keeping menu.<br/>\n"
"                There you can create shifts for house keeping duties and "
"assign employees."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດເມນູ Planning ຈາກແອັບຫ້ອງພັກ, ເມນູ House Keeping.<br/>\n"
"                ບ່ອນນັ້ນທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງກະການເຮັດວຽກຂອງແມ່ບ້ານ ແລະ ມອບໝາຍພະນັກງານໄດ້."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Pricelists from the <strong>Guest House App</strong>, "
"Configuration / Pricelists menu."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດລາຍການລາຄາ (Pricelists) ຈາກ <strong>ແອັບເຮືອນພັກ</strong>, ເມນູ "
"Configuration / Pricelists."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Steering menu and select Availability."
msgstr "ເປີດເມນູ Steering ແລ້ວເລືອກ Availability (ຈຳນວນຫ້ອງວ່າງ)."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Steering menu and select Occupancy."
msgstr "ເປີດເມນູ Steering ແລ້ວເລືອກ Occupancy (ອັດຕາການເຂົ້າພັກ)."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the Survey App to find the customer satisfaction survey."
msgstr "ເປີດແອັບແບບສຳຫຼວດ (Survey App) ເພື່ອກວດເບິ່ງແບບສຳຫຼວດຄວາມພໍໃຈຂອງລູກຄ້າ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the Taxes from the <strong>Invoicing App</strong>, under the "
"Configuration / Accounting menu."
msgstr ""
"ເປີດເມນູ Taxes (ອາກອນ) ຈາກ <strong>ແອັບໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້ (Invoicing App)</strong>, "
"ພາຍໃຕ້ເມນູ Configuration / Accounting."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Open the door for more custom workflows and actions with the power of "
"<strong>Studio\n"
"                App</strong>."
msgstr ""
"ປັບແຕ່ງຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກ ແລະ ຄຳສັ່ງຕ່າງໆໄດ້ຕາມໃຈດ້ວຍປະສິດທິພາບຂອງ <strong>ແອັບ\n"
"                Studio (Studio App)</strong>."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the guest order."
msgstr "ເປີດໃບສັ່ງຈອງຂອງແຂກ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open the order of you just arrived guests."
msgstr "ເປີດໃບສັ່ງຈອງຂອງແຂກທີ່ຫາກໍມາຮອດ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Open your guest order from the Guest House App."
msgstr "ເປີດໃບສັ່ງຈອງຂອງແຂກຈາກແອັບເຮືອນພັກ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"Our guest house is not just a place to stay; it's a place to create lasting "
"memories, filled with comfort and genuine hospitality. Each moment spent "
"here is crafted to make you feel at home."
msgstr ""
"ເຮືອນພັກຂອງພວກເຮົາບໍ່ພຽງແຕ່ເປັນບ່ອນພັກຜ່ອນເທົ່ານັ້ນ; ແຕ່ຍັງເປັນບ່ອນສ້າງຄວາມຊົງຈຳທີ່ຍືນຍົງ, "
"ເຕັມໄປດ້ວຍຄວາມສະດວກສະບາຍ ແລະ ການຕ້ອນຮັບອັນຈິງໃຈ. "
"ທຸກໆຊ່ວງເວລາທີ່ນີ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານຮູ້ສຶກອົບອຸ່ນຄືຢູ່ບ້ານ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_home
msgid "Our rooms"
msgstr "ຫ້ອງພັກຂອງພວກເຮົາ"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid "Paragliding"
msgstr "ກິລາໂດດຈ້ອງ (Paragliding)"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:product.template,description_ecommerce:guest_house.product_template_20
msgid "Perfect for a relaxed evening at the property."
msgstr "ເໝາະສຳລັບຄ່ຳຄືນແຫ່ງການພັກຜ່ອນທີ່ແສນສະບາຍ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Plan, check in and and check out bookings with the <strong>Guest House App</"
"strong>"
msgstr ""
