msgstr "ສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມ"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Setup company or branch specific offers when relevant."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂໍ້ສະເໜີສະເພາະສຳລັບແຕ່ລະບໍລິສັດ ຫຼື ສາຂາຕາມຄວາມເໝາະສົມ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Share your stay offers across your companies and branches (default behavior);"
msgstr "ແບ່ງປັນຂໍ້ສະເໜີຫ້ອງພັກຂອງທ່ານໄປຍັງທຸກບໍລິສັດ ແລະ ສາຂາ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ);"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Simply open the Dashboard App to land on the Performance dashboard."
msgstr "ພຽງແຕ່ເປີດແອັບແຜງໜ້າປັດ (Dashboard App) ເພື່ອເບິ່ງໜ້າສະຫຼຸບຜົນການດຳເນີນງານ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"Sink into pure comfort in our Fireplace room. Radiating soft light and "
"soothing warmth, this room offers a romantic, serene atmosphere that invites "
"you to curl up, slow down, and truly unwind."
msgstr ""
"ສຳຜັດຄວາມສະບາຍຢ່າງແທ້ຈິງໃນຫ້ອງ Fireplace. ດ້ວຍແສງໄຟອ່ອນໆ ແລະ ໄອອຸ່ນອັນສະຫງົບ, "
"ຫ້ອງນີ້ມອບບັນຍາກາດທີ່ໂຣແມນຕິກ ແລະ ເງຽບສະຫງົບ ໃຫ້ທ່ານໄດ້ພັກຜ່ອນ ແລະ ຜ່ອນຄາຍຢ່າງເຕັມທີ່."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid "Skydiving"
msgstr "ກິລາໂດດຈ້ອງຈາກຍົນ (Skydiving)"

#. module: guest_house
#: model:ir.actions.server,name:guest_house.soft_dependency_server_action
msgid "Soft dependency"
msgstr "ຄວາມຂຶ້ນຕໍ່ກັນແບບຍືດຢຸ່ນ (Soft dependency)"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"Step into a haven of self-care. The highlight of the Bubbles room is its "
"stunning, deep copper bathtub; the ultimate centerpiece for soaking away the "
"day’s adventures with a glass of wine in hand."
msgstr ""
"ກ້າວເຂົ້າສູ່ພື້ນທີ່ແຫ່ງການດູແລຕົນເອງ. ຈຸດເດັ່ນຂອງຫ້ອງ Bubbles ແມ່ນອ່າງອາບນ້ຳທອງແດງຊົງເລິກອັນງົດງາມ; "
"ຈຸດສູນລວມແຫ່ງການແຊ່ຕົວພັກຜ່ອນຫຼັງຈາກການເດີນທາງມາໝົດມື້ ພ້ອມຈິບໄວນ໌ໃນມື."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Still from the Guest House App Schedule, simply drag and drop a booking to "
"another\n"
"                more comfortable room!"
msgstr ""
"ຈາກໜ້າຕາຕະລາງຂອງແອັບເຮືອນພັກ, ພຽງແຕ່ລາກ ແລະ ວາງ ລາຍການຈອງ ໄປໃສ່ຫ້ອງອື່ນ\n"
"                ທີ່ສະດວກສະບາຍກວ່າໄດ້ທັນທີ!"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Still from their Rental Order, open the Guests tab."
msgstr "ຈາກໃບສັ່ງຈອງ/ເຊົ່າ, ໃຫ້ເປີດແທັບ 'ແຂກ' (Guests)."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"Surrounding Gabi Guesthouse are 45 unique activities waiting to be "
"discovered. From tranquil forest strolls, local tasting tours, and peaceful "
"garden retreats to energizing bike paths, mountain trails, and outdoor "
"sports, you can design every day to match your mood."
msgstr ""
"ອ້ອມຮອບ Gabi Guesthouse ມີ 45 ກິດຈະກຳທີ່ເປັນເອກະລັກລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ທ່ານມາສຳຜັດ. "
"ຕັ້ງແຕ່ການຍ່າງປ່າອັນງຽບສະຫງົບ, ທົວຊີມອາຫານທ້ອງຖິ່ນ, ການພັກຜ່ອນໃນສວນ ຈົນເຖິງເສັ້ນທາງປັ່ນລົດຖີບ, "
"ເສັ້ນທາງປີນເຂົາ ແລະ ກິລາກາງແຈ້ງ, ທ່ານສາມາດອອກແບບແຕ່ລະມື້ໄດ້ຕາມໃຈ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
"Take BART to Balboa Park Station. From there, board the 29 bus toward "
"Bayview and get off at Executive Park. The building at 250 Executive Park "
"Blvd, Suite 3400, is just a short walk from the stop."
msgstr ""
"ຂີ່ລົດໄຟ BART ໄປລົງສະຖານີ Balboa Park Station. ຈາກນັ້ນ, ຂຶ້ນລົດເມສາຍ 29 ມຸ່ງໜ້າໄປ Bayview "
"ແລ້ວລົງທີ່ Executive Park. ອາຄານເລກທີ 250 Executive Park Blvd, Suite 3400 "
"ຈະຢູ່ຫ່າງຈາກບ່ອນຈອດລົດເມພຽງໄລຍະທາງຍ່າງສັ້ນໆ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The Gantt chart is color-coded to reflect on the availability for you to "
"work on filling in."
msgstr "ແຜນພູມ Gantt ຖືກແຍກດ້ວຍສີ ເພື່ອສະແດງສະຖານະຫ້ອງວ່າງ ໃຫ້ທ່ານວາງແຜນຮັບການຈອງໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The Gantt chart is color-coded to reflect on the occupancy, the higher the "
"better."
msgstr "ແຜນພູມ Gantt ຖືກແຍກດ້ວຍສີ ເພື່ອສະແດງອັດຕາການເຂົ້າພັກ, ຍິ່ງສູງຍິ່ງດີ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid "The King's path"
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງແຫ່ງກະສັດ (The King's path)"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The Occupancy view allows you to visualize your \"Sales Success\". It "
"answers one simple question: <i>How well am I filling my guest house?</i>"
msgstr ""
"ມຸມມອງອັດຕາການເຂົ້າພັກ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຫັນພາບ \"ຄວາມສຳເລັດຂອງຍອດຂາຍ\". ເຊິ່ງຕອບຄຳຖາມງ່າຍໆວ່າ: "
"<i>ເຮືອນພັກຂອງເຮົາມີຄົນພັກເຕັມດີສ່ຳໃດ?</i>"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The strength of Odoo is to separate the accounting and many other aspects "
"which are company dependent!"
msgstr "ຈຸດເດັ່ນຂອງ Odoo ແມ່ນການແຍກລະບົບບັນຊີ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນຕ່າງໆ ຕາມແຕ່ລະບໍລິສັດໄດ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ!"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The tasks are assigned to balance cleaning points from the stay offers "
"within employees assigned to the associated house keeping role."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າວຽກຈະຖືກມອບໝາຍໂດຍການຄິດໄລ່ຄະແນນການທຳຄວາມສະອາດຈາກຂໍ້ສະເໜີຫ້ອງພັກ "
"ເພື່ອແບ່ງວຽກໃຫ້ແກ່ພະນັກງານແມ່ບ້ານຢ່າງເທົ່າທຽມກັນ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Then empty the fiscal position so that the tax applies regardless of your "
"customer's fiscal position."
msgstr ""
"ຈາກນັ້ນລຶບສະຖານະທາງການເງິນ (Fiscal position) ອອກ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີການນຳໃຊ້ອາກອນໂດຍບໍ່ຂຶ້ນກັບສະຖານະທາງການເງິນຂອງລູກຄ້າ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"These all go free in your current subscription; feel free to explore! 🙃"
msgstr "ທັງໝົດນີ້ລວມຢູ່ໃນແພັກເກດປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວໂດຍບໍ່ເສຍຄ່າເພີ່ມ; ເຊີນທົດລອງໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ເລີຍ! 🙃"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"They as well share the same pricing, defined at the stay offer level, which "
"has its pros and cons."
msgstr "ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງໃຊ້ລາຄາດຽວກັນ ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນລະດັບຂໍ້ສະເໜີຫ້ອງພັກ ເຊິ່ງມີທັງຂໍ້ດີ ແລະ ຂໍ້ເສຍ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "They want multiple rooms?"
msgstr "ລູກຄ້າຕ້ອງການຈອງຫຼາຍຫ້ອງບໍ່?"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "They were happy about their stay, let's ask them to leave a review."
msgstr "ແຂກມີຄວາມປະທັບໃຈໃນການເຂົ້າພັກ, ມາເຊື້ອເຊີນໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາຊ່ວຍຣີວິວກັນເຖາະ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This blocks simulataneously all resources related to this working schedule "
"during the prescribed period."
msgstr ""
"ການດຳເນີນການນີ້ຈະປິດກັ້ນທຸກຊັບພະຍາກອນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບຕາຕະລາງເວລານີ້ພ້ອມກັນ ໃນຊ່ວງເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "This capability is enabled by a setting you can set/unset."
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ສາມາດເປີດ ຫຼື ປິດ ໄດ້ຜ່ານການຕັ້ງຄ່າ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This configuration step may be required to avoid any tax collection "
"inconsistency."
msgstr "ຂັ້ນຕອນການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ອາດຈຳເປັນ ເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງຄວາມຜິດພາດໃນການຮຽກເກັບອາກອນ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This setup can be used for all products that must keep local tax rates (e.g. "
"late check-in)."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບສິນຄ້າ ແລະ ບໍລິການທຸກຢ່າງທີ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ອັດຕາອາກອນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (ເຊັ່ນ: ຄ່າທຳນຽມອອກຊ້າ)."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This setup is relevant in case of place specific offers or when pricing "
"varies between places."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເໝາະສົມສຳລັບກໍລະນີທີ່ມີຂໍ້ສະເໜີສະເພາະບ່ອນ ຫຼື ເມື່ອລາຄາແຕ່ລະບ່ອນແຕກຕ່າງກັນ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This time click the Add to last order button to add this room to the booking "
"and\n"
"                voila!"
msgstr ""
"ຄັ້ງນີ້ໃຫ້ກົດປຸ່ມ 'ເພີ່ມໃສ່ໃບສັ່ງຫຼ້າສຸດ' (Add to last order) ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຫ້ອງນີ້ເຂົ້າໃນການຈອງ ແລ້ວກໍ\n"
"                ຮຽບຮ້ອຍ!"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This time, simply leave a note about the why this is booked and save the "
"slot."
msgstr "ຄັ້ງນີ້, ພຽງແຕ່ຂຽນບັນທຶກເຫດຜົນໃນການຈອງ ແລ້ວກົດບັນທຶກຊ່ອງເວລານີ້."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "To benefit from this capability, activate the corresponding setting."
msgstr "ເພື່ອໃຊ້ງານຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, ໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Trace guest attendance"
msgstr "ຕິດຕາມການເຂົ້າພັກຂອງແຂກ"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"True to its name, Lumos is designed to feel bright, airy, and full of "
"positive energy. Sun-drenched by day and soothing by night, it’s the perfect "
"space to awaken feeling fully refreshed and inspired."
msgstr ""
"ສົມກັບຊື່, Lumos ຖືກອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ໂປ່ງສະບາຍ, ສະຫວ່າງ ແລະ ເຕັມໄປດ້ວຍພະລັງບວກ. "
"ຮັບແສງແດດອົບອຸ່ນໃນຕອນກາງເວັນ ແລະ ສະຫງົບໃນຕອນກາງຄືນ, "
"ເປັນພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ດີເລີດສຳລັບການຕື່ນນອນດ້ວຍຄວາມສົດຊື່ນ ແລະ ພ້ອມຮັບແຮງບັນດານໃຈໃໝ່ໆ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Two options are now available to you with multiple companies and branches:"
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ມີ 2 ທາງເລືອກສຳລັບທ່ານ ໃນການຈັດການຫຼາຍບໍລິສັດ ແລະ ສາຂາ:"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Type in the customer name in the Schedule search bar filtering by Customer."
msgstr "ພິມຊື່ລູກຄ້າລົງໃນແຖບຄົ້ນຫາຂອງຕາຕະລາງ (Schedule) ໂດຍກັ່ນຕອງຕາມ 'ລູກຄ້າ' (Customer)."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid "Type your message here..."
msgstr "ພິມຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງທ່ານຢູ່ນີ້..."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid "We are committed to delivering hight experience."
msgstr "ພວກເຮົາມຸ່ງໝັ້ນທີ່ຈະມອບປະສົບການທີ່ດີເລີດທີ່ສຸດ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
"We offer a warm, personal touch you won't find in big hotels; comfortable "
"rooms, homemade breakfasts, and hosts who genuinely care about your stay."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາມອບຄວາມອົບອຸ່ນ ແລະ ການດູແລຢ່າງໃກ້ຊິດທີ່ທ່ານຈະບໍ່ພົບໃນໂຮງແຮມໃຫຍ່; ຫ້ອງພັກທີ່ສະດວກສະບາຍ, "
"ອາຫານເຊົ້າແບບເຮັດເອງ, ແລະ ເຈົ້າຂອງເຮືອນທີ່ໃສ່ໃຈການພັກຜ່ອນຂອງທ່ານຢ່າງແທ້ຈິງ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
"We welcome well-behaved pets in select rooms;&amp;nbsp;just let us know in "
"advance so we can prepare accordingly."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຍິນດີຕ້ອນຮັບສັດລ້ຽງທີ່ໜ້າຮັກໃນບາງຫ້ອງພັກທີ່ກຳນົດ;&amp;nbsp;ພຽງແຕ່ແຈ້ງໃຫ້ພວກເຮົາຮູ້ລ່ວງໜ້າ "
"ເພື່ອການກະກຽມທີ່ພ້ອມພຽງ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
"We're just a short walk from the town center, close to local restaurants, "
"shops, and public transport."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຢູ່ຫ່າງຈາກໃຈກາງເມືອງພຽງໄລຍະທາງຍ່າງສັ້ນໆ, ໃກ້ກັບຮ້ານອາຫານທ້ອງຖິ່ນ, ຮ້ານຄ້າ ແລະ "
"ລະບົບຂົນສົ່ງສາທາລະນະ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_home
msgid ""
"Welcome to <span class=\"o_text_highlight o_text_highlight_jagged\" "
"style=\"--text-highlight-color: var(--o-color-1); --text-highlight-width: "
"3px;\">Gabi</span> Guesthouse"
msgstr ""
"ຍິນດີຕ້ອນຮັບສູ່ ເຮືອນພັກ <span class=\"o_text_highlight o_text_highlight_jagged\" "
"style=\"--text-highlight-color: var(--o-color-1); --text-highlight-width: "
"3px;\">Gabi</span> Guesthouse"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Welcome your guests as well from the <strong>Guest House App</strong>."
msgstr ""
"ຕ້ອນຮັບແຂກຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຢ່າງສະດວກຜ່ານ <strong>ແອັບເຮືອນພັກ (Guest House App)</strong>."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_home
msgid ""
"We’re thrilled to have you here. Nestled in a peaceful setting, Gabi "
"Guesthouse offers cozy rooms, friendly service, and a relaxed atmosphere to "
"help you recharge.<br/><br/>Whether you're visiting for leisure or work, "
"we’re dedicated to making your stay as comfortable and memorable as "
"possible. Ready to relax? Explore our rooms and reserve your stay today!<br/"
"><br/>Which vibe fits your guesthouse best (e.g., cozy/rustic, modern/"
"boutique, budget-friendly), or is there a specific location/amenity you'd "
"like to highlight?"
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາດີໃຈຫຼາຍທີ່ໄດ້ຕ້ອນຮັບທ່ານ. ທ່າມກາງບັນຍາກາດອັນງຽບສະຫງົບ, Gabi Guesthouse "
"ມອບຫ້ອງພັກທີ່ອົບອຸ່ນ, ການບໍລິການທີ່ເປັນກັນເອງ ແລະ ບັນຍາກາດຜ່ອນຄາຍ "
"ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານໄດ້ສາກພະລັງຢ່າງເຕັມທີ່.<br/><br/>ບໍ່ວ່າທ່ານຈະມາທ່ອງທ່ຽວພັກຜ່ອນ ຫຼື ເຮັດວຽກ, "
"ພວກເຮົາມຸ່ງໝັ້ນທີ່ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການພັກຜ່ອນຂອງທ່ານສະດວກສະບາຍ ແລະ ໜ້າປະທັບໃຈທີ່ສຸດ. ພ້ອມທີ່ຈະພັກຜ່ອນແລ້ວບໍ່? "
"ສຳຫຼວດຫ້ອງພັກ ແລະ ຈອງຫ້ອງຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ເລີຍມື້ນີ້!<br/><br/"
">ບັນຍາກາດແບບໃດທີ່ເໝາະກັບເຮືອນພັກຂອງທ່ານທີ່ສຸດ (ເຊັ່ນ: ອົບອຸ່ນ/ແບບບ້ານໆ, ທັນສະໄໝ/ບູຕິກ, ປະຢັດ), ຫຼື "
"ມີສະຖານທີ່/ສິ່ງອຳນວຍຄວາມສະດວກໃດທີ່ທ່ານຢາກເນັ້ນເປັນພິເສດບໍ່?"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"Whatever your speed, return each evening to the tranquil comfort of your "
"guesthouse sanctuary."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ວ່າຈັງຫວະຊີວິດຂອງທ່ານຈະເປັນແນວໃດ, ກັບມາພັກຜ່ອນໃນແຕ່ລະແລງດ້ວຍຄວາມສະຫງົບ ແລະ ສະບາຍ "
"ໃນເຮືອນພັກອັນແສນອົບອຸ່ນ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"When creating an offer, assign them a company or a branch.<br/>As a result, "
"they are available only for the selected company or branch, and will be "
"available only from its website."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອສ້າງຂໍ້ສະເໜີ, ໃຫ້ມອບໝາຍບໍລິສັດ ຫຼື ສາຂາໃຫ້ຂໍ້ສະເໜີນັ້ນ.<br/"
">ເຊິ່ງຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ສະເໜີນັ້ນສະແດງສະເພາະບໍລິສັດ ຫຼື ສາຂາທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ ແລະ "
"ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະໃນເວັບໄຊຂອງສາຂານັ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.website_sale_product_oe_structure_website_sale_product_2
msgid ""
"Whether you're into culture, scenic hikes, relaxing retreats, or local "
"crafts, you'll find plenty to do around the guesthouse. Please be sure to "
"book your activities in advance, or feel free to ask our team to help you "
"plan your itinerary!"
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ວ່າທ່ານຈະມັກດ້ານວັດທະນະທຳ, ການຍ່າງປ່າຊົມວິວ, ການພັກຜ່ອນຢ່ອນໃຈ ຫຼື ງານຫັດຖະກຳທ້ອງຖິ່ນ, "
"ທ່ານຈະພົບເຫັນກິດຈະກຳຫຼາກຫຼາຍອ້ອມຮອບເຮືອນພັກ. ກະລຸນາຈອງກິດຈະກຳລ່ວງໜ້າ ຫຼື "
"ສາມາດສອບຖາມທີມງານຂອງພວກເຮົາເພື່ອຊ່ວຍວາງແຜນການເດີນທາງຂອງທ່ານໄດ້!"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"While Occupancy focuses on what is full, the Availability view focuses on "
"what is left to sell. It is your primary tool for operational safety and "
"\"Scarcity Pricing.\""
msgstr ""
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ອັດຕາການເຂົ້າພັກ (Occupancy) ສຸມໃສ່ຈຳນວນຫ້ອງທີ່ເຕັມ, ມຸມມອງຫ້ອງວ່າງ (Availability) "
"ຈະສຸມໃສ່ຈຳນວນຫ້ອງທີ່ຍັງເຫຼືອໃຫ້ຂາຍ. ເຊິ່ງເປັນເຄື່ອງມືຫຼັກສຳລັບຄວາມປອດໄພໃນການດຳເນີນງານ ແລະ "
"ການກຳນົດລາຄາຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Willing to upgrade a booking?"
msgstr "ຕ້ອງການຍົກລະດັບ (Upgrade) ການຈອງບໍ່?"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"With over 45 activities around us, picking the right ones can feel tricky! "
"Here are the 5 guest-favorite experiences you simply can’t go wrong with."
msgstr ""
"ດ້ວຍກິດຈະກຳຫຼາຍກວ່າ 45 ຢ່າງອ້ອມຮອບເຮືອນພັກ, ການເລືອກອາດຈະຍາກແດ່! ນີ້ແມ່ນ 5 "
"ປະສົບການຍອດນິຍົມທີ່ແຂກປະທັບໃຈຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດ ເຊິ່ງທ່ານບໍ່ຄວນພາດ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"With the create slot for this resource, no overlapping booking slot would be "
"created.<br/>Care about the start and end time or this blockage to make to "
"re-open when suited."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອສ້າງຊ່ອງເວລາສຳລັບຊັບພະຍາກອນນີ້, ຈະບໍ່ມີການສ້າງຊ່ອງການຈອງທີ່ທັບຊ້ອນກັນໄດ້.<br/"
">ກະລຸນາກວດສອບເວລາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ສິ້ນສຸດຂອງການປິດກັ້ນນີ້ ເພື່ອເປີດຮັບການຈອງຄືນໃໝ່ເມື່ອພ້ອມ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Would you like to discuss your Odoo setup with us or go even further?"
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງການປຶກສາການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Odoo ກັບພວກເຮົາ ຫຼື ພັດທະນາລະບົບເພີ່ມເຕີມບໍ່?"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
"Yes, a freshly prepared breakfast is included every morning, made with local "
"and seasonal ingredients whenever possible."
msgstr "ແມ່ນແລ້ວ, ລວມອາຫານເຊົ້າປຸງແຕ່ງສົດໃໝ່ທຸກໆເຊົ້າ ໂດຍເນັ້ນນຳໃຊ້ວັດຖຸດິບທ້ອງຖິ່ນ ແລະ ຕາມລະດູການ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
"Yes, both free parking and high-speed Wi-Fi are available throughout your "
"stay at no extra cost."
msgstr ""
"ແມ່ນແລ້ວ, ມີທັງບ່ອນຈອດລົດຟຣີ ແລະ Wi-Fi ຄວາມໄວສູງໃຫ້ບໍລິການຕະຫຼອດການເຂົ້າພັກໂດຍບໍ່ມີຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍເພີ່ມ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You are repairing a room or simply welcoming family and don't want guests to "
"book it?<br/>Alternatively, you are closing for a week during an inter "
"season break?<br/>Let's have this reflected in your schedule!"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານກຳລັງສ້ອມແປງຫ້ອງ ຫຼື ຕ້ອງການຕ້ອນຮັບຄອບຄົວ ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຢາກໃຫ້ແຂກທົ່ວໄປຈອງ?<br/>ຫຼື "
"ທ່ານກຳລັງປິດເຮືອນພັກເປັນເວລາໜຶ່ງອາທິດໃນຊ່ວງປິດລະດູການ?<br/"
">ມາກຳນົດສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ລົງໃນຕາຕະລາງຂອງທ່ານກັນເລີຍ!"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can access every installed App in your Odoo database on your main "
"dashboard."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າໃຊ້ງານທຸກແອັບທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ Odoo ໄດ້ຈາກແຜງໜ້າປັດຫຼັກ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can as well select your company and in the Branches tab define branches."
msgstr "ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເລືອກບໍລິສັດຂອງທ່ານ ແລະ ກຳນົດສາຂາຕ່າງໆໄດ້ໃນແທັບ ສາຂາ (Branches)."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can create an alternative customer satisfaction survey and select it "
"from the Automated Survey settings, as well as configure the email delay as "
"you wish the email to be sent after the guest checkout."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງແບບສຳຫຼວດຄວາມພໍໃຈຂອງລູກຄ້າຮູບແບບອື່ນ ແລະ "
"ເລືອກໃຊ້ມັນຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບສຳຫຼວດອັດຕະໂນມັດ "
"ລວມທັງກຳນົດໄລຍະເວລາສົ່ງອີເມວຫຼັງຈາກແຂກອອກຈາກຫ້ອງພັກໄດ້ຕາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You completed that demo use case! There are millions of other ways to adapt "
"your\n"
"                    Odoo setup to fit your business needs."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານໄດ້ສຳເລັດການທົດລອງຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ແລ້ວ! ຍັງມີອີກຫຼາກຫຼາຍວິທີໃນການປັບແຕ່ງ\n"
"                    Odoo ໃຫ້ກົງກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການຂອງທຸລະກິດທ່ານ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You could customize this section to add the identity document picture or "
"extra\n"
"                    fields at your convenience with studio. Just be careful, "
"such customizations can\n"
"                    quickly become messy."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງພາກສ່ວນນີ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມຮູບເອກະສານຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ ຫຼື ເພີ່ມຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນ\n"
"                    ອື່ນໆໄດ້ຕາມສະດວກດ້ວຍ Studio. ແຕ່ຄວນລະວັງ, ການປັບແຕ່ງຫຼາຍເກີນໄປອາດ\n"
"                    ເຮັດໃຫ້ລະບົບສັບສົນໄດ້."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You didn't import demo data? You can still do it. Go to Apps &gt; Industries "
"&gt;\n"
"                    Upgrade your package and check the related box"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງເທື່ອບໍ? ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້. ໄປທີ່ Apps &gt; Industries &gt;\n"
"                    Upgrade your package ແລ້ວໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ຫ້ອງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "You guest house is online and future guests found it!"
msgstr "ເຮືອນພັກຂອງທ່ານເປີດອອນລາຍແລ້ວ ແລະ ລູກຄ້າກໍໄດ້ພົບເຫັນມັນ!"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "You have a future guest on the line willing to book a room?"
msgstr "ມີແຂກກຳລັງຕິດຕໍ່ສອບຖາມເພື່ອຈອງຫ້ອງພັກບໍ່?"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You just installed the Odoo for Guest House package. By doing so, we have "
"installed a\n"
"            bunch of necessary apps to run your business efficiently."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຫາກໍຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ Odoo ສຳລັບເຮືອນພັກ. ເຊິ່ງລະບົບໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ\n"
"            ບັນດາແອັບທີ່ຈຳເປັນຕໍ່ການດຳເນີນທຸລະກິດຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງສຸດ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You may be running multiple places at the same time and most likely be "
"willing to run them all from the same database.<b/>We got you covered with "
"this using multiple companies or branches!"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານອາດກຳລັງຄຸ້ມຄອງຫຼາຍສະຖານທີ່ພ້ອມກັນ ແລະ ຕ້ອງການບໍລິຫານທັງໝົດຈາກຖານຂໍ້ມູນດຽວກັນ.<b/"
">ພວກເຮົາຮອງຮັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການນີ້ດ້ວຍລະບົບຫຼາຍບໍລິສັດ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍສາຂາ!"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You may want to uplift your margin during high season and be attractive "
"during low one playing on price.<br/>To do so, let's define price rules."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານອາດຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມກຳໄລໃນຊ່ວງລະດູທ່ອງທ່ຽວ (High season) ແລະ ດຶງດູດລູກຄ້າໃນຊ່ວງໂລຊີຊັນ (Low "
"season) ດ້ວຍລາຄາພິເສດ.<br/>ເພື່ອເຮັດແນວນັ້ນ, ມາກຳນົດກົດລະບຽບລາຄາກັນເລີຍ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "You might have tested this package with or without demo data."
msgstr "ທ່ານອາດໄດ້ທົດລອງແພັກເກດນີ້ໂດຍມີ ຫຼື ບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You noticed that the Identity Check highlights whether you captured all the\n"
"            necessary information for a guest?"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສັງເກດເຫັນບໍ່ວ່າ ລະບົບກວດສອບເອກະສານຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຈະແຈ້ງເຕືອນວ່າ ທ່ານໄດ້ບັນທຶກ\n"
"            ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນຂອງແຂກຄົບຖ້ວນແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່?"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You now know how to create a new order.<br/>Let's replicate the previous "
"steps but\n"
"                this time, without confirming the order (just saving it as "
"draft)."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານຮູ້ວິທີສ້າງໃບສັ່ງໃໝ່ແລ້ວ.<br/>ລອງເຮັດຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ຄືນ\n"
"                ແຕ່ຄັ້ງນີ້, ຍັງບໍ່ຕ້ອງຢືນຢັນໃບສັ່ງ (ພຽງແຕ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ເປັນສະບັບຮ່າງ)."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You should be able to execute the following flows to have an overview of "
"various flows\n"
"            you can quickly execute with this package using Odoo."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຄວນທົດລອງຂັ້ນຕອນການເຮັດວຽກຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ ເພື່ອເບິ່ງພາບລວມຂອງລະບົບຕ່າງໆ\n"
"            ທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວໃນແພັກເກດ Odoo ນີ້."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "You welcome your first guests, awesome!"
msgstr "ທ່ານໄດ້ຕ້ອນຮັບແຂກກຸ່ມທຳອິດແລ້ວ, ຍອດຢ້ຽມຫຼາຍ!"

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "You're now waiting for your guest to arrive."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານກຳລັງລໍຖ້າແຂກເດີນທາງມາຮອດ."

#. module: guest_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:guest_house.view_page_home
msgid ""
"Your Dynamic Snippet will be displayed here... This message is displayed "
"because you did not provide both a filter and a template to use.<br/>"
msgstr ""
"Dynamic Snippet ຂອງທ່ານຈະສະແດງຢູ່ນີ້... ຂໍ້ຄວາມນີ້ສະແດງຂຶ້ນເນື່ອງຈາກທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດຕົວກັ່ນຕອງ "
"ແລະ ຮູບແບບແມ່ແບບທີ່ຈະນຳໃຊ້.<br/>"

